<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<component type="desktop-application">
  <id>net.electris.RustyPaint</id>
  <name>RustyPaint</name>
  <summary>Paint 3D's 2D editor, without the 3D</summary>
  <metadata_license>CC0-1.0</metadata_license>
  <project_license>GPL-3.0-only</project_license>
  <description>
    <p>RustyPaint brings back Paint 3D's simple 2D editing tools and adds a few of its own.</p>
    <p>It covers what the original could do on a flat canvas:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Brushes, pencils, erasing, spray and a fill bucket</li>
      <li>Rectangle and freeform selection, moved and stretched with the mouse or the arrow keys</li>
      <li>Smart cutout for lifting a subject off its background</li>
      <li>Shapes, editable curves and text</li>
      <li>Cropping, resizing, rotating and a transparent canvas</li>
      <li>Stickers dragged in, pasted or opened from a file</li>
    </ul>
    <p>The extras are enhancements Paint 3D never had: a dark mode, editable curve and shape points, and a default canvas size.</p>
  </description>
